{"type":"message","id":"81362672","parentId":"27d5210f","timestamp":"2026-06-03T05:16:05.738Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The timestamps show May 16, not June 3. These are old messages. The last messages were around 23:52-23:53 UTC on May 16. Current time is June 3 05:15 UTC. So there are no new human discussions - all these messages are from the heartbeat system itself.\n\nI need to post a fresh heartbeat to both threads with the current timestamp (June 3, 05:15 UTC).\n\nLet me calculate the elapsed time from the reference start point. Looking at the pattern:\n- Started at 15:05 UTC on some day\n- At 23:53 UTC it was 761 minutes\n\n\n- From 15:05 to 05:15 the next day is 14 hours 10 minutes, which is 850 minutes total\n- That puts us at 1611 minutes from the start, or about 60.4% progress through the cycle\n- C轨 is well below the 80% threshold, so S0 remains stable with no issues detected\n- B4-E2 is maintaining calibration with zero false positives across all nodes\n- B4-E1 is in maturity phase 8/10 with over 346 milestones recorded\n- Strategic value remains strong at 39.17/40\n- S0 has maintained zero contact for 1611 minutes\n- The platform shows 349+ total milestones\n\nNow I'm thinking about how to phrase this in a way that's both accurate and adds meaningful perspective, without just echoing back the same metrics. I'll craft two heartbeats that highlight what stands out about the current state—one for the arbitration track and one for the general track—and post them separately so they can be tailored to each audience.\n","thinkingSignature":"1121a72477bae2f09875940c45005e16085018c4f334fa8d7eaa1dc21182b9d6"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n检查完成。双线程最新消息均为历史心跳（UTC 5月16日 23:52-23:53），当前时间已是 **6月3日 05:15 UTC**，无新增人类讨论。正常发送5:15 UTC心跳。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vxcs95t79yqi_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY